########## txCoLab (kotlinx-coroutines-core only)
## [e11] @Transactional suspend fun with a JDBC TransactionManager
kotlinx-coroutines-reactor on classpath = false
kotlinx-coroutines-core jar = kotlinx-coroutines-core-jvm-1.10.2.jar
transactionManager = org.springframework.jdbc.support.JdbcTransactionManager

### [e11] (A) @Transactional suspend fun
| point | thread | isActualTransactionActive | transaction name |
|---|---|---|---|
| listener: begin | main | - | suspendTx |
| 1 entry, before first suspension | main | true | suspendTx |
| listener: commit | main | - | suspendTx |
| 2 after delay(100) | main | false | - |
| 3 inside withContext(Dispatchers.IO) | DefaultDispatcher-worker-1 | false | - |
| 4 after withContext | main | false | - |
rows another connection sees right after delay(100) resumed: 1 [before-delay]
outcome: caller got java.lang.IllegalStateException: roll back on purpose
rows left after the exception (another connection): 2 [before-delay, in-io]

### [e11] (B) suspend fun → withContext(IO) → plain @Transactional fun
| point | thread | isActualTransactionActive | transaction name |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 entry (no @Transactional on the suspend fun) | main | false | - |
| listener: begin | DefaultDispatcher-worker-1 | - | work |
| 2 inside a plain @Transactional fun called within withContext(Dispatchers.IO) | DefaultDispatcher-worker-1 | true | work |
| listener: rollback | DefaultDispatcher-worker-1 | - | work |
rows another connection sees right after delay(100) resumed: 0 []
outcome: caller got java.lang.IllegalStateException: roll back on purpose
rows left after the exception (another connection): 0 []

########## txCoLabReactor (+ kotlinx-coroutines-reactor)
